### All hotels (no filter)
GET http://localhost:8080/hotels

### Text search — by name
GET http://localhost:8080/hotels?q=beach

### Text search — by description keyword
GET http://localhost:8080/hotels?q=tropical

### Text search — by address
GET http://localhost:8080/hotels?q=sentosa

### Text search — case-insensitive
GET http://localhost:8080/hotels?q=HILTON

### Travellers — solo (1 adult)
GET http://localhost:8080/hotels?travellers=1+0

### Travellers — couple (2 adults)
GET http://localhost:8080/hotels?travellers=2+0

### Travellers — couple + 1 child
GET http://localhost:8080/hotels?travellers=2+1

### Travellers — couple + 2 children
GET http://localhost:8080/hotels?travellers=2+2

### Travellers — group (3 adults)
GET http://localhost:8080/hotels?travellers=3+0

### Travellers — family (3 adults + 2 children)
GET http://localhost:8080/hotels?travellers=3+2

### Travellers — large group (4 adults)
GET http://localhost:8080/hotels?travellers=4+0

### Travellers — large family (4 adults + 2 children)
GET http://localhost:8080/hotels?travellers=4+2

### Combined — text search + travellers
GET http://localhost:8080/hotels?q=tokyo&travellers=2+0

### Combined — address search + family preset
GET http://localhost:8080/hotels?q=shinjuku&travellers=3+2

### Invalid travellers value — expects 400
GET http://localhost:8080/hotels?travellers=99+0

### No match — expects empty array
GET http://localhost:8080/hotels?q=paris
